924442b0474?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3104ff1bbaa1699bbdec1c9a1700369 2x, https://si.imgix.net/885e44f4/uploads/origins/075cedf2-cc7f-4f68-87ad-8924442b0474?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e710e06e99f401358b47cedb14b07849 3x"}, "body": "Hi I'd like to commission you to make art of an OC. Here's a tweet with pictures (you don't have to read the text), and I want you to pick whichever you like best and draw them however you like.\n\nPlease do the drawing in whatever style makes you comfortable. I represent a video game company, but we are not using your art for commercial purposes. Thank you!\n\nこんにちは、OCのアート制作を依頼したいんだ。ここに写真付きのツイートがあるので（文章は読まなくていい）、好きなものを選んで好きなように描いてほしい。\n\nあなたが描きやすいスタイルで描いてください。私はゲーム会社の代表ですが、あなたの絵を商業目的で使用することはありません。ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/sw_rho/status/1681167351369068544", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@todo666/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2331812, "client_id": 53582, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e721c945/uploads/origins/a9c1929a-1225-450c-8fe8-dac9ef402eca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58c6efb9ad27486dd6aa8ca62abd5b25", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e721c945/uploads/origins/a9c1929a-1225-450c-8fe8-dac9ef402eca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58c6efb9ad27486dd6aa8ca62abd5b25, https://si.imgix.net/e721c945/uploads/origins/a9c1929a-1225-450c-8fe8-dac9ef402eca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe5089f1504824b46d2a51a74e35232e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e721c945/uploads/origins/a9c1929a-1225-450c-8fe8-dac9ef402eca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c507d7bb751636